      "sourceHash": "f2584161b59eec04",
      "translationZh": "[3] [ICML 2024 最佳论文] Khan A, Hughes J, Valentine D, 等. 与更具说服力的大语言模型辩论会带来更真实的回答. arXiv 预印本 arXiv:2402.06782, 2024.",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
